      "query": "{\"content\": \"# Predicted Reasoning: *Allison Nguyen v. Louisiana* (No. 26-19)\\n\\nThe Supreme Court will **deny** the petition for a writ of certiorari after the State of Louisiana files its requested Brief in Opposition.\\n\\n## Procedural Path: Further Distributions and CVSG\\n\\n- **Current distribution state and further distributions (`relist-increment`):** The docket currently records **one distribution** (`Sep 15 2026`, for the Conference of October 9, 2026), followed on October 9, 2026 by a **",
